  "details": "Hello,\nThere is obviously missed something with security if SDK and game file modders are STILL able to upload and keep working those HORRIBLE CRASHER AVATARS that penetrate safety settings and kill all processes that are critical for entire windows thus bricking whole PC until power is forced off, in less direct impact just breaking oculus software and displayport output in drivers.\nIt only gets worse for new players ( visitor rank) who just build expensive vr setup to play this game only to get whole pc crippled in most common social rooms people may go most likely ( box, open mic etc). You dont even put clear and attention grabbing warnings to use custom safety or atleast medium preset settings nor do you enable medium setting by default.\nYour incompetence to enable serverwide particle and poly limit to stop loading obviously dangerous to hardware monstrosities just baffles me.\n\nIf you cant code that then ATLEAST put warning to use and point towards how-to instructions that cant be casually looked over when joining game first time because currently visitors dont even know whats safety menu!\n\nThank you for reading, it was written for improvement of game and pointing out how dangerous the game environment has become to casual noob player and due to hacking its likely even real hardware damages will follow.\nLawsuits for property damages arent far future either if current situation doesnt get any fixes.",
